en.html:
《Not a gap for a horse on the barrier road;
the Prince fell from his horse six times and was much troubled.》

《Because he had not slept the night before,
they set a temporary seat at Byoudou-in, and tore away the middle span of Uji Bridge.》

《River waves below, men standing above;
white banners <ruby>streaming<rt>streaming</rt></ruby> together, they waited for the approaching foe.》

